type: software
title: "Quare: QUality AnalyzeR of application Efficiency"
abstract: >-
  Python ETL and analytics framework that ingests, stores and visualises
  performance-profiling data from HPC applications, currently focused on
  OpenFOAM CFD workloads with AMD uProf counters and MPI profilers.
